vatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-01-29T10:41:46Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T02:34:02Z","closed_at":"2026-02-02T19:08:08Z","assignee":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6 stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 10 (build 19044) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.1659) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 13.85 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI open several archives through FileAccess, and keep them open in the autoload for the rest of the entire application lifecycle. On Desktop (Windows/Linux) it causes no issues. With the introduction of Storage Access Framework (SAF for short) in Godot 4.6, I've decided to target Android platforms. Unfortunately, during the application lifecycle, at seemingly random, but somewhat consistent points in application lifecycle, crashes happen. They have coincided with my attempts to `seek` and `get_buffer` through an opened FileAccess, which have shown `W DataAccess: java.io.IOException: Bad file descriptor` warnings in `adb logcat`. So, somehow, file descriptors become invalidated, with me having no part in it. I didn't have to suspend the app, and I have tried to persist URI, with no success. So what I *suspect* might be happening is the file gets closed by GC's finalizer, as those can run at unpredictable points in time, but may be more or less consistent. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/543f47485c0c952b122747ef05af60e778c44139/platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/io/file/SAFData.kt#L178 may have the potential culprit; although I cannot find a single mention of it in Google's own documentation, I may have seen some rumors going about similar issues associated with `ParcelFileDescriptor`. Notably, I assume `ParcelFileDescriptor` is the owner, and `FileDescriptor` it gives is borrowed, unable to keep GC references alive. Storing `ParcelFileDescriptor` in a field may resolve the bug.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Obtain a valid treeURI from `DisplayServer.file_dialog_show` with `FILE_DIALOG_MODE_OPEN_DIR`.\n- Use it to open several files of your choosing, and never close nor dereference them.\n- Attempt to do various tasks of unclear nature.\n- Check if file operations are proceeding correctly. Sometimes they fail.\n\nDo note that if GC finalizers are at play, there is no way to guarantee that they won't run for any amount of time, however, keeping files opened for longer increases the chance of encountering it's occurence.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI can't demonstrate a MRP, since it appears to be a heisenbug. I humbly ask to not close this issue for the lack of demonstration, as it makes impossible to work with SAF in any capacity.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115567/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}